# --- local data NEVER uploaded (FR8) ---
# zero-storage architecture: no catalog db ships (github/npm/crates are searched live);
# local capture dumps at repo root + TRACKING/etc stay machine-local.
# (curated gallery assets/screenshots/ DOES ship — README embeds it; regen via scripts/screenshots.ps1)
/screenshots/
TRACKING.md
TOOLS-INDEX.md
aio-context.md
/.freebuff/
*.env
.env*

# --- backups & runtime state (machine-local) ---
.aio/
node_modules/

# --- editor/OS noise ---
*.log
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
